Cell["\<\
On a path the whole graph is a line; any proper stretch is not, since it can \
still be prolonged.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"66af5f93-64c9-4091-a056-e05ed4b2f180"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
